  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Schrift X — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have learned to use your cursed seal to cause yourself to phase instead of your attacks. As a bonus action for 6 cursed energy, you release the cursed seal over your eye to activate your technique. You gain immunity to bludgeoning, piercing and slashing and resistance to all other damage other than psychic for 1 minute and must maintain concentration.</p>\n<p>While <em>Intangibility</em> is active, you cannot use your innate technique features. only allowing for normal attack actions. You can end the technique at any point as a free action to close your left eye.</p>",
